        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage Saturn Grade 2 Commercial Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nADA compliant Schlage Saturn commercial lever is a grade 2 leverset, it is for light to medium commercial applications. UL listed for all functions up to 3 hour doors on fire doors. Comes standard with a 2-3/4 inch backsets. This lever and rose set will work with door thickness ranges from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" align=\"right\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Saturn LAX-Series Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2, 1996, Series 4000, Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>10 year limited warranty for all functions.</li>\r\n<li>UL fire rated for 3 hour fire door.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: 6 Pin Cylinder C Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rhodes Schlage Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/10</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-15/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 2-5/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Crossbore Size: 2-1/8\" Bore with Two 5/16\" Post Holes</li>\r\n<li>Latch Faceplate Dimension: 1-1/8\" x 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Field Reversible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Passage (ANSI F75):</b> Latching only, both levers always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (ANSI F86):</b> The outside lever is fixed. Entrance from the outside is done only by the use of a key. The inside lever is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
